    },
    {
        "text": "A layer of snow has formed on the withered branch. The Rift Cloudbeast climbs to its tip, squinting in an impression of scouting."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saintess sighs, turning around to look behind her. The huntress following her pauses, her face slightly red from the wind."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Joanna... you don't need to follow me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm very grateful for all that you've done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I told you, though, the Pilgrimage must be completed alone. Strictly speaking, I shouldn't even be talking to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not following you. I'm not your guard or your servant. I just happen to be traveling in the same direction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I won't talk to you. If anyone sees us, I'll pretend I don't know you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't let danger strike you again. I'll just follow behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know where I'm going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#3$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wherever you're going, I'm going. That's all I need to know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I'm looking for Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking for Her... did She disappear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know. But disaster will strike Kjerag again if She doesn't return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "People will lose their lives, and even more will lose their faith...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must return to the Vine-Bead Court and consult the tomes. The others must not know, for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'll follow you. Don't worry, if anyone's on your tail, I'll chase them away for you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$2",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Purr\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think the Rift Cloudbeast just saw something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the direction that the Rift Cloudbeast is looking, the trail to the Vine-Bead Court is filled with people dressed in solemn colors."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like... someone very important just passed away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who could it be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enya shakes her head. She cannot help but feel a shiver down her spine, thick though her clothes are."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you alright, Enya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll go slowly, around the crowd.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
