        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Dark clouds hang low, almost touching the temple's eaves. It is a cold day even by Kjerag standards, and the north wind seems to penetrate the eyes and spines of the mourners."
    },
    {
        "text": "Family members and clerics gather in the courtyard with heads bowed. The people of the Browntail domain have gathered outside, to honor and grieve their matriarch, who protected Kjerag with her life."
    },
    {
        "text": "Snow falls upon the black umbrellas. One of the Browntail nobles gives the one in his hand a little shake, and sighs as the snow pours down."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, the matriarch's body...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Browntail Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_274_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They never found it. The fire was too big. They turned over every inch of whatever was left, but found nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Browntail Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard they had to put her usual attire in the coffin, along with some ashes gathered from the scene. Nothing more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Browntail Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How sad... to think that one as bright as the matriarch would\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Browntail Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Madam Sciurus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Browntail Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I apologize. I spoke out of turn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Browntail Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "step",
        "loop": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "step",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus does not answer. She walks to the center of the courtyard, waiting for her sister, who had been by her side for long as she could remember."
    },
    {
        "text": "Chimes tremble to the melody of the flutes. The clerics put their hands together and chant Kjeragandr's hymn, and the people place their hands upon their hearts in prayer to the song\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kjeragandr have mercy, take her with you."
    },
    {
        "text": "Six members of Clan Browntail's main branch carry a heavy nanmu wood coffin up the muddy road, Yucatan at the head of the procession."
    },
    {
        "text": "They carefully lay the coffin down on a table, in front of the new Browntail matriarch."
    },
    {
        "text": "Yucatan walks to his wife, the grief on his face contrasting with Sciurus's calm expression."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#4$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yucatan...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rus, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hymn draws to a close. All is quiet and all eyes fall on Sciurus."
    },
    {
        "text": "For the first time, she understands the mask that Ratatos was forced to wear, the weight of responsibility, which crushes those unworthy of it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for being here, to honor the memory of Ratatos Browntail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was my sister, staunch guardian of Clan Browntail, and faithful child of Kjeragandr...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her wisdom gave her courage. She told me that she would protect me and everything here... and she always believed in a better tomorrow for Kjerag, even in the most troubling times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "All her life, she carried out the task that our grandfather entrusted to her, giving everything to Clan Browntail, even in her final moments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have lost someone very dear to me. It is only today that I realize the weight of the burden that she carried, but I will never have the chance to tell her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you will remember her face, her voice, her sacrifice, and her deep love... for Kjerag, for Clan Browntail, and for her family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you will remember, as I do, who took her from us, leaving behind wounds that can never fully heal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "'A life so short and bright as dawn, shall walk with Her in eternity'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "'By Kjeragandr,' answer the crowd, following Sciurus' lead as they kneel and pay respect to the departed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Even in times like these, when all is swept up in calamity, Kjeragandr will continue to bring peace and tranquility to the people of Kjerag..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Two figures emerge from the crowd as those in attendance stand back up. It is Arctosz and Matterhorn, approaching the coffin with white flowers in hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My condolences, Sciurus...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ratatos died because of me. I'll never forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Arctosz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a painful lesson to both our clans, to recognize who our true enemies are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#10$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Matriarch Sciurus...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir Enciodes expresses his regret for not being able to attend the funeral, and sends his apologies and condolences. He will pay a visit to Browntail Manor personally, when the time is right. Please take care, Matriarch Sciurus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's so busy he can't even come to the funeral?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. I understand. Clan Browntail recognizes the work that Enciodes has done for Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us continue the ceremony. I believe we have matters to discuss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
