        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The crowd departs. The empty coffin is buried on Browntail land, next to the grandfather who loved her so dearly."
    },
    {
        "text": "With lips pressed together, Sciurus looks to the two men before her. Both look slightly angry."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm simply reiterating the decision of the last Tri-Clan Council, Sir Arctosz: All external affairs shall be handled by Sir Enciodes and Clan Silverash, including matters associated with Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this why you had the nerve to demand the Victorian spies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "The murder of the Browntail Matriarch is no small affair. I won't allow the Silverashes to interrogate them on your own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Master Matterhorn, it was the Matriarch of Clan Browntail who was assassinated. I believe Clan Browntail should have full authority on this matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Enciodes not pleased with this arrangement?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not. However, it is a matter of principle to defer to the tradition of the Tri-Clan Council. There is formal and rational justification for allowing Clan Silverash to handle the spies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've deferred to Silverash enough already, Matterhorn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "You people have given us nothing but excuses when it comes to negotiating with the Victorians, and now these people have conducted terror attacks in broad daylight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about we invite Enciodes to explain his attitude towards the Victorians and what he's planning to Sciurus's face, and then we can talk about the spies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kindly refrain from baseless speculation, Sir Arctosz. I have already shown considerable restraint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "text": "You and Matriarch Ratatos were not the only ones to be attacked. Lady Ensia also narrowly escaped with her life. I would like nothing more than to get my hands on the assassins personally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, if that's true, then this will be easy enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll put the Victorians on trial in front of all Kjerag, and then we let Clan Browntail have their way with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let all Terra know that Kjerag shows no mercy to our enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too reckless!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We already interrogated them. They were awfully tight-lipped. I doubt a public trial would achieve anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Instead, I'm worried they may see that as an opportunity to get a rise out of the people. It's not a risk we can take, with all the unrest in Kjerag right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they have the guts to do so, just cut their tongues out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should have dragged them out and spilled their blood for Ratatos at the funeral!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arctosz... no one wants vengeance for my sister more than I do. But we can't get carried away while there is still the hope of actually coaxing some information from them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Matriarch Sciurus is right. This is a matter for\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please excuse the interruption. A cleric from the Vine-Bead Court has something to discuss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Browntail Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The last envoy from Vine-Bead Court almost got Arctosz and Ensia killed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do I know you are who you say you are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no need to be concerned. Sir Arctosz knows me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's right, this is Father Frey from the Vine-Bead Court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright then. What is it you want to say, Father?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am here for the Victorian spies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The position of the Vine-Bead Court is that this is an extremely delicate issue. There will be considerable criticism and unrest, no matter which of the three clans takes charge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Therefore, the spies should be placed in the custody of the Court. We shall arrange interrogations, of which you will be informed and in which you'll have the opportunity to participate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I object. Why delay things when we're going to kill them anyway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Vine-Bead Court can't do this. The Tri-Clan Council has already decided that Clan Silverash will handle Victorian affairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Need I remind you that the Tri-Clan Council also agreed to return temporal power to the Court?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saintess is on her Pilgrimage right now. The Vine-Bead Court cannot decide on her behalf!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is interesting that you would mention the Saintess now, when Sir Enciodes has always been at odds with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "All Kjerag knows that the Saintess and the Vine-Bead Court have always been of one mind. The scriptures speak testament to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Vine-Bead Court has often acted on behalf of the Saintess in her absence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell Sir Enciodes he should not presume to take all the power for himself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Father\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down, Matterhorn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clan Browntail accedes to the request. You can send your people tomorrow, Father, and we will hand the spies over to the Vine-Bead Court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know your concerns, but it's more important than ever to put aside the conflicts between the three clans... it would be great to have the Vine-Bead Court mediate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your wisdom, Matriarch. The Vine-Bead Court prays for Clan Browntail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus bows to the Vine-Bead Court envoy."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "67_G4_kjeragstreet",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "direction": 0,
        "fillfrom": 0.01,
        "fillto": 0.08,
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "direction": 4,
        "fillfrom": 0.01,
        "fillto": 0.08,
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It is past noon, and the funeral procession begins to disperse."
    },
    {
        "text": "A man sitting in a car parked a little bit away witnesses the scene, then draws the curtain over the window."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like someone is getting impatient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "There has been a lot of movement in the Vine-Bead Court ever since the Saintess's departure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was surprised that Ratatos was willing to go this far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Using herself as bait to draw out the Victorian spies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "An impressive performance that brought the actions of Victoria into the daylight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if the Victorians are trying to instigate a war between her and the other clans, this is also the most effective way to cleanse any suspicion from Clan Browntail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not enough... we must make good use of the valuable time that Ratatos bought us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't you show up at her funeral?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to avoid direct conflict with the other clan leaders, especially in public.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... How's Enya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her injuries were minor. All the Victorian assassins are dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enya says she has a plan to carry out in secret. She told me to come back, once we cleaned up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the people know is that the Saintess is currently on her Pilgrimage. All the Victorians know is that their assassination attempt failed. You've wiped out all the traces from the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's certainly true that the presence of the legendary Black Knight would not be conducive to secrecy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what I thought as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a bad plan. I also need people I can trust by my side for what is to come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our real troubles have only just begun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wadmoney",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enciodes takes out an envelope and hands it to Degenbrecher. Inside is a thick stack of agreements, and a letter written in Victorian."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Read it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A letter? From whom?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could call it a letter...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or a declaration of war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
