    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$lab_intro",
        "key": "$lab_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "To the Chairman of Karlan Trade, the son of my kinswoman Elizabeth\u2014",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nDear Enciodes Silverash,",
        "x": 380,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nI hope this letter finds you well. It has been more than a decade since we met at that banquet.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nPerhaps you recalled our conversations, as I did, when you heard about recent events in Victoria. You foretold the conflicts that I was personally involved in, and you have earned the right to sit at the table with Victoria as equals.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nBut do not forget that every step you have taken is on a path that Victoria wants to see taken, one which she has paved for you.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "Victoria's position remains the same after the Catastrophe. We support Kjerag's development and respect Kjerag's faith. And I believe that Clan Silverash and Kjerag have never needed more help than now.",
        "x": 180,
