        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nKarlan Trade will not need to provide any cash. After all, there are many places where it can be put to good use, considering present circumstances in Kjerag. I believe this to be a fair sign of good faith.",
